# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(55328.9609913277+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(55328.9609913277+-54993.5210716306)
